          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_step_algorithm_checks_whether_remain",
          "text": "At each step, the algorithm checks whether the remaining per-language budget can still be split evenly.",
