          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_language_would_exceed_epochs_over",
          "text": "If a language would exceed N epochs over its own corpus, it is capped at N epochs, and the freed budget is redistributed uniformly among the languages that remain.",
